@startuml next-activity
' next — Activity diagram
' Source procedure: coordination/template/process/next.md
title next — board-driven session orientation
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FDFDFD

start
:Human invokes next\n(never proactive);

:Step 0 — pull state\n(freshness, local hygiene, board fetch,\nissue and PR lists);

:Run kanban_check.sh\n(steps 0-3 report, read-only);

:Step 1 — sync pass (global)\n(match board to ground truth);

if (Stale work claim older than 24h\nwith no PR and no branch?) then (yes)
  :Verify nothing landed,\nsupersede claim, re-queue to Todo;
else (no)
endif

:Step 2 — cleared-gate pass (global, claim-guarded);

if (Closed gate with no finalized marker?) then (yes)
  :Claim, read payload, do what it unblocks,\nfinalize Processed acknowledgment;
else (no)
endif

if (Open gate with unacknowledged human comment?) then (yes)
  if (Comment is an explicit decision?) then (yes)
    :Process and close with attribution;
  else (no)
  endif
  if (Comment is a change request?) then (yes)
    :Supersede claim, re-queue to Todo\n(do not auto-start);
  else (no)
  endif
  if (Comment is ambiguous?) then (yes)
    :Surface to human, never guess;
  else (no)
  endif
  if (Comment is a question?) then (yes)
    :Answer in a reply comment;
  else (no)
  endif
else (no)
endif

:Step 3 — human nudge\n(report, do not nag);

:Step 4 — pick one work card\n(lowest Todo issue in lane, or poach;\na passed card number is the pick, other text filters);
:Claim before work\n(comment Claiming with nonce, verify lowest ID);

:Step 5 — plan with the human\n(read-only investigation, ask questions);
:Present plan and wait for explicit approval;

if (Plan approved?) then (no)
  :Record blocker, return card to Todo;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

:Record approved plan on the card;
:Step 6 — do the work\n(verify with tests / headless browser);

:Step 7 — hand-off before the PR\n(fresh-eyes review results, testing report);

if (User experience changed?) then (yes)
  :Add a proposed manual test for the human;
else (no)
endif

:Present to the human — wait for accept or defer;
:Open a DRAFT PR and move card\nto Awaiting code review;

:Human promotes to ready-for-review and merges;
stop
@enduml
